>

  <p>
    Renting in London has a reputation for being stressful, expensive and competitive — and
    honestly, that reputation is partly earned. But once you understand how the system works,
    what you're entitled to, and what to watch out for, it becomes a lot more manageable.
    This guide walks you through the whole process from search to signing.
  </p>

  <!-- ── Finding a property ──────────────── -->
  <h2>Where to find properties</h2>

  <p>
    Most rentals in London are listed on one of a handful of major platforms. Each has a
    slightly different focus:
  </p>

  <div class="partner-grid">
